This example grows a bar from empty to full.
```css
.bar {
  width: 100%;
  animation: fill 3s linear both;
}
@keyframes fill {
  from { width: 0; }
  to { width: 100%; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .bar { animation: none; }
}
```
